    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Richard Elkins became the first permanent settler in Harts, arriving around 1807 or 1815.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harts%2C_West_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "During the Civil War, nearly all local men from Harts served in the Confederate States Army.",
