        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harts%2C_West_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The C&O Railroad began passing through the town of Harts in 1904.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
